      <h1 class="jr-h1">Marine vs Bovine Collagen: Which Should You Take?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Marine collagen is made from fish skin and scales. Bovine collagen is made from cow hide,
        which is a dealbreaker in a lot of Indian homes before the science even gets a hearing. Here is the
        honest comparison: collagen types, peptide size, dietary fit, taste, and cost per gram that
        actually does something.
      </p>

